[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024798524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108160#issuecomment-3024798524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108160","id":3024798524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60SsM8","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-01T16:49:22Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T18:43:53Z","body":"This is likely caused by section highlighting:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e1b4101e3460dd9c6ba0b7f8d88e9751b8383f5b/editor/plugins/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L331-L333\n\nIf we can find a way to ensure the highlighting is only applied if it begins at the beginning of a line, this should fix nearly all instances of the issue.\n\n> I'm not sure when syntax highlighting was added for cfg, ini and json files (haven't check the other formats), or if it is a byproduct of another PR.\n\nThis was implemented by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/77972.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3024798524/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3026586846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108160#issuecomment-3026586846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108160","id":3026586846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60Zgze","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T06:14:21Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T06:15:14Z","body":"> If we can find a way to ensure the highlighting is only applied if it begins at the beginning of a line, this should fix nearly all instances of the issue.\n\nHow would that work, since no array really starts at the beginning of a line? I suppose you could try to use `=[` to find the beginning of the array declaration, but you could declare them a million different ways since ConfigFiles ignore whitespace:\n\n```GDScript\n[array section]\n\none=[1, 2, 3]\ntwo = [ 1,   2, 3 ]\nthree =\n[ 1, 2,\n3,\n]\n```\n\nAll of those would load just fine, the parser doesn't mind. All that to say I don't see how this is solvable without counting the brackets.\n\nCould this and the attached PR be relevant? https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103242","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3026586846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387056404","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108160#issuecomment-3387056404","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108160","id":3387056404,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J4mEU","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T18:28:53Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T18:33:28Z","body":"> Could this and the attached PR be relevant? [#103242](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103242)\n\nGDScript uses a custom syntax highlighter written from scratch, while ConfigFile uses the generic keyword-based system available in SyntaxHighlighter out of the box.\n\nIdeally, we should have more precise ways to define highlight regions without resorting to a custom highlighter, so we don't have to fully replace the implementation to fix this issue.\n\n@dalexeev How realistic would it be to have a method/parameter to make a region start pattern require to be at the beginning of a line? I'd envision an optional parameter, since regex-like `$`/`^` markers would break compatiblity with existing projects that may already be using those symbols literally in regions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387056404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387128299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108160#issuecomment-3387128299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108160","id":3387128299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J43nr","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T18:52:32Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T18:52:32Z","body":"> How realistic would it be to have a method/parameter to make a region start pattern require to be at the beginning of a line?\n\nDo you mean `CodeHighlighter::add_color_region()`? You can try to use the same approach I used in `GDScriptSyntaxHighlighter::add_color_region()` for raw strings (`p_r_prefix` parameter). See:\n\n* #90419","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387128299/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]